# The vendored pipeline, per docs/LLD-tutorial-lane.md §5.1. Until the copy
# lands these paths do not exist; the lines are here so the first `git add .`
# after a V0 commit cannot sweep them in by accident. §5.3's vendor_manifest.json
# is NOT ignored: it is the record of what was taken and what was left.
src/doc_to_video_channel/vendor_manifest.json.tmp

# The course-transcript corpus. RIGHTS.md §0 permits local parser-fixture use
# only, and §8.4 requires it referenced by external path, gitignored, with
# synthetic .docx for CI. Never commit these.
transcripts/
*.docx

# WIP artefacts from the review cycle. docs/adopt.txt and docs/claude-review.txt
# were transient triages, folded into docs/LLD-tutorial-lane.md §15 and removed.
*-summary.txt

